---
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { explorations } from '../data/demo';
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/gallery.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>Tiga perspektif untuk BKC — Eksplorasi landing page</title><meta name="description" content="Tiga alternatif landing page Bumi Kala Charta: Atlas, Observatorium, dan Ruang. Dibangun dengan design system BKC." /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/bkc/styles.css" /><link rel="icon" href="/bkc/assets/mark-squirrel-green.png" /></head>
<body class="theme-gallery"><main class="gallery-wrap"><header class="gallery-header"><a href="/" class="gallery-brand"><img src="/bkc/assets/logo-emblem.png" width="40" height="40" alt="Logo Bumi Kala Charta" /><span>BUMI KALA CHARTA</span></a><span class="eyebrow">Eksplorasi website / September 2026</span></header><a class="gallery-hero-link" href="/heroes/"><span><small>EKSPLORASI TERBARU / 04 HERO</small>Empat hero. Empat cara bergerak.</span><Icon name="arrow" size={24}/></a><section class="gallery-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Satu identitas. Tiga perspektif.</span><h1>Menemukan<br />ruang untuk <span>BKC.</span></h1></div><p>Tiga eksplorasi landing page dan company profile dengan design system Bumi Kala Charta. Pilih sebuah arah, jelajahi seluruh halaman, dan coba interaksinya.</p></section><section class="gallery-grid" aria-label="Tiga alternatif desain">{explorations.map(e=><article class={`exploration-card card-${e.slug}`}><a class="preview-window" href={`/${e.slug}/`} aria-label={`Buka mockup ${e.name}`}><div class="preview-frame"><img src={`/mockup-previews/${e.slug}.webp`} alt={`Tampilan landing page ${e.name}`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="eager" /></div><span class="preview-open"><Icon name="arrow" size={20} /></span></a><div class="gallery-card-meta"><span class="eyebrow">{e.number} / {e.descriptor}</span><a href={`/${e.slug}/`}><h2>{e.name}</h2><Icon name="arrow" size={22} /></a><p>{e.description}</p><div class="gallery-tags">{e.tags.map(t=><span>{t}</span>)}</div><a class="gallery-enter" href={`/${e.slug}/`}>Jelajahi mockup<Icon name="right" size={17} /></a><a class="gallery-profile-link text-link" href={`/${e.slug}/tentang/`}>Company profile<Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a></div></article>)}</section><section class="gallery-details"><div><span class="eyebrow">Yang bisa dijelajahi</span><p>Profil dan aktivitas BKC, filter portofolio, peta dengan enam titik contoh, bacaan terkait, ruang kegiatan, serta alur percakapan kolaborasi.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Satu sumber desain</span><p>Logo, mark tupai, font IBM Plex, palet hijau–oranye, dan motif kontur menggunakan aset asli design system BKC. Konten pekerjaan dan publikasi bersifat ilustratif.</p></div></section><footer class="gallery-footer"><span>Astro · BKC Design System · Tanpa backend</span><span>Desktop & mobile / Mockup interaktif</span></footer></main></body></html>
